            "textTrivialFlag": 0,
            "title": "Excellent location, comfortable room and cozy atmosphere.",
            "__typename": "TextDetails",
            "negativeText": "Room had strange smell at time, probably due to being stuffy. Window cannot be opened too wide to let fresh air in.",
