          "partnerReply": {
            "__typename": "PropertyReplyData",
            "reply": "Hello Reinhard,\n\nThank you for your kind words and for taking the time to share your experience with us.\n\nWe are delighted to hear that you found our team polite and enjoyed the style of our interiors. Creating a welcoming atmosphere paired with a distinct design is something we take great pride in, and it is wonderful to know it resonated with you.\n\nWe truly appreciate your recommendation and hope to welcome you back again soon.\n\nWarm Regards,\n\nDAVID SPILLANE\nDIRECTOR OF ROOMS & SAFETY\nACE HOTEL NEW YORK"
          },
