          "negativeHighlights": null,
          "reviewScore": 8,
          "editUrl": null,
          "partnerReply": {
            "reply": "Hello Barry,\n\nI’m so glad you enjoyed the location, the vibe, and all the nearby spots, especially the juice bar, Black Seed Bagels, and the convenience of the 28th Street station right on the block. It really does make getting around the city quick and easy.\n\nI appreciate your note on the bunk room as well. They can feel a bit snug for two, and next time we’d be happy to help guide you toward a room with a bit more space.\n\nThanks again for the great feedback, and we hope to have you back with us soon.\n\nWarm Regards,\n\nDAVID SPILLANE\nDIRECTOR OF ROOMS & SAFETY\nACE HOTEL NEW YORK",
            "__typename": "PropertyReplyData"
          },
          "photos": null,
          "reviewedDate": 1775571401,
          "textDetails": {
            "textTrivialFlag": 0,
            "title": "Super Duper loved it",
            "lang": "en",
            "positiveText": "Really good location. Lovely vibe. Great facilities accessible from hotel including juice bar and black seed bagles. 28th street station on the same block for ease of up/down town travel at speed.",
            "__typename": "TextDetails",
            "negativeText": "The bunk room was a little tight for two."
          },
