          "editUrl": null,
          "reviewScore": 7,
          "photos": null,
          "partnerReply": {
            "__typename": "PropertyReplyData",
            "reply": "Hello John,\n\nThank you for sharing your feedback, and I’m glad you enjoyed the location, the team, and the atmosphere in the lobby.\n\nI’m sorry for the confusion around the breakfast. The included breakfast is a set offering, and certain items like specialty coffees or additional sides are not part of that package, which can result in an added charge. That said, it should feel clear and straightforward, and I understand how that could be frustrating.\n\nI also appreciate you calling out the shower controls and overall room setup. That’s helpful feedback for us as we continue to improve the experience.\n\nThanks again for taking the time to share this.\n\nWarm Regards,\n\nDAVID SPILLANE\nDIRECTOR OF ROOMS & SAFETY"
          },
          "reviewedDate": 1773850909,
          "textDetails": {
