          "partnerReply": {
            "reply": "Hello Kim,\n\nThank you for taking the time to share your feedback. I am glad to hear you enjoyed the location and that it made exploring the city and accessing the subway easy during your stay. It is also great to hear you enjoyed the coffee shop and happy hour. It is a favorite for many of our guests and locals alike.\n\nI do apologize for the inconvenience you experienced with the elevators during your visit. We appreciate your patience while we worked through those issues.\n\nThank you again for staying with us and for sharing your experience. We hope to welcome you back to Ace Hotel New York on a future trip.\n\nWarm Regards,\n\nDAVID SPILLANE\nDIRECTOR OF ROOMS & SAFETY\nACE HOTEL NEW YORK",
