            "reply": "Hello Pieter,\n\nThank you for taking the time to share your feedback. I am very glad to hear that you loved the room and found it spacious and quiet, and that overall you had a stay that would bring you back to us again.\n\nI do apologize for the inconvenience caused by the lift being out of service and the longer wait times that resulted. I am also sorry to hear that the public restrooms on the ground level were not in the condition they should have been. Cleanliness in all guest-facing spaces is very important to us, and I appreciate you bringing this to our attention so we can reinforce these standards with our team.\n\nThank you again for staying with us, and we hope to welcome you back on your next visit to New York.\n\nWarm Regards,\n\nDAVID SPILLANE\nDIRECTOR OF ROOMS & SAFETY\nACE HOTEL NEW YORK",
